<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:014d25bfa7e5a1db897b19f3e7be11d92406ffc1>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 90 contributors in alphabetic order:

Alex Lamoreaux; Alicia Del Toro; Allie Smith; Alvaro Jaramillo; Amanda Urena; Avery Fretwell; Becky O'Neill; Ben Hagler; Bonnie Furman; Bradley Vanston; Brian Gibbs; Brian Shaw; Carey Bergman; chelsea bradley; Chestina; Christian Harvey; Cindy Belko; Craig Emery; Dane McDermott; Daniel Bianchetta; David  Bailey; David Beeninga; David Brown; Deirdre Doyle; Delaney Trowbridge; Doug Cheeseman - †; Eleanor Kotler; Elizabeth; Elizabeth Robinson; Emily Tate; Era Horton; Eric Austin Yee; Evan Brodsky; Gail Koza; Gerard Menut; Gordon Gates; Hadley Gross; jackie schwiesow; James Moskito; Jeff Fairbanks; Jennifer Stoudt; Jeremy Hathaway; Joe Meuleman; Johanna Domise; Josh; Joshua Meza-Fidalgo; Kate Pennington; Keith Grundy; Ken Schultz; Kirsten MacTaggart; Kourtney Burger; Laura Lopez; Leslie Rapp; Liam Ragan; Logan Pallin; Lory Barra; Mallory Emerson; Marilia Olio; Mark Girardeau; Maryjanna Zosia; Mason Donny; Max Block; Maxim Cheeran; McKenna Miller; Michael Pierson; Molly Batts; Monika Wieland Shields; Mya; Nico Heyning; Nicola Manu; Nina Moysi; Oksana Savenko; Paige Siegel; Peter Bedrossian; Rebecca Malkewicz; R.J. Adams; Robin Lowe; Robin Rowland; Rose Franklin; Ryan A. Vienna; Ryan Lawler; Sam Fellows; Sara Franson; Sarah Grimes; steve; Sydney Minges; Ted Cheeseman; Tracy Desiderio; Trinitie Seeber; Warren_G_Asher""" ;
