<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:054f6095702ba28a3e655d43e3aa658dea582754>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 50 contributors in alphabetic order:

Adrian Boyle; Andrew Peacock; Antoine Viot; Bob Schafer; Boo Borsberry-Woods; Caleb &amp; Sable; Christine Corke; Cindy Miller Hopkins; Conor Ryan; Corinne Eichler; Derek Grant; De Wulf Maurina (maluga); Dirk-Jan Saaltink; Eline De Raedt; Espaço Talassa; Evelin Breuers; Javier Cotin; John House; Joshua Meza-Fidalgo; Kerstin Langenberger; Kevin Elsby; Kimberly Nesbitt; Leon King; Lobosonda; Lomvi; Lucile Sachot; Lynda Adams; Marian Unitt; Marilia Olio; Mark Morse; Martin Jamieson; Michael Jackson; Mirko Reichert; Mitch Doucet; MS Fridtjof Nansen; MS Spitsbergen; M/Y On Liberty; Paolo Bellezze; Philip Precey; Phillippa Tichotova; Phil Sykes; Pia Lange; Raghavan Nair; Ricardo Ventura; Rita Da Costa Leitão; Sigrún Helgudóttir; Steph &amp; Oli Prince; Tara Byrne; Thomas Kohn; Tim Martin""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
