<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:0d437f6a509a11a43c77d8ce344d1a213d6a89b0>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "The aim of this study was to describe the gradient of the benthic algal vegetation along the coast of Berufjördur, with focus on the influence of salinity and substrate configuration on the zonation patterns and the leading algal associations. Additionally, attention was paid to the differences between the main algal zones on sheltered versus exposed sites of rocky formations." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Algae, Phytobenthos, Rocky shores, Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Survey of the benthic algal vegetation of the Berufjördur, southeastern Iceland" ;
