    ecsummary:description "Data on pelagic fishes from German North Atlantic cruises from the 1970s to 1980s kept by the Zoological Museum of Hamburg (ZIM Hamburg). The dataset was provided to MAR-ECO by Dr. Heino Fock. Primary reference: Post, A. 1987. Pelagic transects of FRVs \"Walther Herwig\" and \"Anton Dohrn\" in the Atlantic Ocean 1966 to 1986. Mitt. Inst. f. Seefischerei d. BfaFi Hamburg, 42: 1-68." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Museum collections, Occurrence, Observation" ;
