<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:0f2629a02359fd7529cdcca18b0f291b31d1f2af>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 576 contributors in alphabetic order:

Aaron Foster; Aaron Kreisberg; Adam Ernster; adam maire; Adrian Boyle; Aeon for Ocean; Aimee; Alain Bidart; Alayna Hawkins; Alexander Allison; Alexia Skrbic; Alex Lamoreaux; Alex Rubenstein; Alicia Buzzard; Allee Goodfellow; Allie Smith; Alvaro Gabaldon; Alvaro Jaramillo; Alyssa Engiles; Amanda Urena; Ambrose Carrejo; Ami Clayton; Amy McNeely; Amy Venema; Andoni Arrambide; Andrea; andrea Laughlin; Andrew D. MacDonald; Andrew Micks; andy hart; Angela E Waterbury; Angelika Ludwiczak; Angelo Fernandez; Angie Wrightson; Anieke Brombacher; Anika Miskar; Anna Astafurova; Anna Blake; Annalese Bletsch; Annamarie Dunn; Anna Stalcup; Annette Lucas; Annette Weeks; Anthony Perella; Arthur Lewison; Ashish Kushwaha; Ashley Ruis; Ashly Fraser; Aubrey Jurgerson; Autumn Harms; Avery Fretwell; Avery Williamson; Avi Anand; Baja Wild Encounters; Becci Jewell; Becker Juergen; Becky Hilsen; Ben Hagler; Benjamin Lewis Hargrave; Benjamin Shulman; Berit Solstad; Bernhard; Beth Fetty; beth holiman; Beth Kleymeyer; Bill; bill sturgeon; Blain &amp; Monique Anderson; Blake Kremer; Bobby Ellithorpe; Bobby Harman; Bob Lippert; Bob Schafer; Bonnie Furman; Bradley Vanston; Brandon Korody; Brandt Ziegler; Brandy Fields; Breck Morrison; Brendan Keane; Brian Iske; Bridget Forstmann; Brooke Schafer; Bruce Haldors; Bryan McDonald; CA Edson; Caitlyn Ware; California Killer Whale Project; Camila Londono; Camilo Rada; Carey Bergman; Carlos Navarro; Carlos Pedrós-Alió; Caroline Kelley; Caroline Kempton; Caroline Patterson; Carol Irwin; Carol May; Carol Wilson; Carolyn Anderson; carter cox; Casey McKerchie; Catherine Ryan; Cathryn Thomas; Cecilia Ruiz; Celia Garland; Chad Carlson; Charlie Pingree; Charlie Wright; Charlize Uptegrove; Chase Enloe; Chawki; chelsea bradley; Chelsie Corcoran; Cheng-Hui Wong; Chris Biertuempfel; Chris Hill; Chris Mills; Christian Adlhart; Christian Harvey; Christopher Pankhurst; Christy Ware; Chris Witwer; Clint Walden; Clint William; Colby Bechtold; Colleen gervais; Constantin Sc