<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:145a535ccccb45b187b4dadcfa7f7154edbfa4f4>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 47 contributors in alphabetic order:

Alex Cowan; Alex Searle; Atlantiangra - whale watching; Barry Gutradt; Chad Carlson; Christina Frech; Corinne Eichler; Dare Harcourt; Denise Woolton; Diana Palandri; Emilia Mussoni; Emma Lever; Espaço Talassa; Franck Hollander; Gal·la Edery; GordieBryce; Holly Patterson; Jesper Nielsen; Jin Cao; John House; Kimberly Nesbitt; Lobosonda; Luís MD Barcelos; Marilia Olio; Matthew Messina; Melissa Martel ROMM; MONICET; MS Spitsbergen; Nicolas PANIER; Nikki; Norbert; Paul Spillmann; Phil Schultz; Ricardo Ventura; Rita Da Costa Leitão; Robert Wälter; ROSHINI JOHRI; Sandrine Papias; Sarah Kather; Sea Fever Productions; Suzanne Wafer; Tanja; Thomas Goetz; Tiffany Zamolsky; TijsHans; Ton Knijnenburg; Ulla Christina Ludewig""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Blue whale in North Atlantic Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/988cd984-9166-44ab-83fb-e98ffe5735ef> ;
.

