Project sponsor or sponsor description
The project was generously funded by The Mackay Regional Council and is supported by the volunteers of Mackay &amp; District Turtle Watch Association and students of James Cook University.


Abstract:
The project is an initiative of Ken Griffin, Secretary of Mackay and District Turtle Watch Association. It is a collaboration between Mackay &amp; District Turtle Watch Assoc. and James Cook University to understand the behaviour of flatback turtles in Central Queensland. The four turtles were named by children of local schools.

Supplemental information:
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/index.shtml?project_id=1061">Visit STAT's project page</a> for additional information.

This dataset is a summarized representation of the telemetry locations aggregated per species per 1-degree cell.""" ;
