<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:197f82cc2bc217631556d6a1886e64b9d2b97f72>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Kiril Valchev

Dataset credits:
Kiril Valchev

Abstract:
The present database is intended to serve as a catalogue for photo-identification 
of bottlenose dolphins in the Bulgarian Black Sea area. It is part of a larger study 
of cetaceans in the Exclusive Economic Zone (EEZ) of Bulgaria and in NATURA 
2000 protected areas where the species is subject to conservation.

Purpose:
Аims to provide information on population structure, seasonal migrations and 
distribution patterns of bottlenose dolphins in the Bulgarian waters of the Black 
sea.

Supplemental information:
It is intended to be updated periodically.""" ;
