    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 53 contributors in alphabetic order:

Allie Smith; Andy Price; Captain Kevin; Capt. Alexander Legaspi; Capt Nicholas robbins; Carla Mitroff; Cecilia Ruiz; chelsea bradley; Chris Biertuempfel; Christina de la Fuente; christy bode; Curt Finfrock; Dale Frink; Dane McDermott; Daniel Cayton; Dan Robinson; Era Horton; Eric Austin Yee; Erik Combs; Francisco Javier Ledezma López; Gail Koza; Gordon Gates; Holger van Dorp; Jessica Roame; Joe Meuleman; Joshua Meza-Fidalgo; Julene Jackman Lennon; Kátia Silva; Kimberly Nesbitt; Laura; Linda McWilliams; Marilia Olio; Mark Girardeau; Max Block; Mike Justa; Mindy Huston; Molly Batts; M White; Nico Heyning; Patricia VanOver Indictor; Peter Bedrossian; Riley; Robin Lowe; Ron Charbonneau; Ryan Lawler; Sebastian Shaw; Slater T Moore; Steve OToole; Swish; Sydney Minges; Tracy Desiderio; Vanuza borges; Yoko Sathorn""" ;
