Dataset credits:
Data provider
Gardangarl (Field Island) flatback turtle monitoring
Originating data center
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/">Satellite Tracking and Analysis Tool (STAT)</a>


Abstract:
Gardangarl (Field Island) is critical habitat for flatback turtles.The annual flatback tagging and monitoring program provides valuable data for the only marine turtle listed globally as “Data Deficient” by the International Union for the Conservation of Nature (IUCN).This research has occurred since the 1980s; &amp; every year since approx 1995

Supplemental information:
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/index.shtml?project_id=1033">Visit STAT's project page</a> for additional information.

This dataset is a summarized representation of the telemetry locations aggregated per species per 1-degree cell.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Marine Biology, Observation, Occurrence" ;
