<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:241e78bb7a40f42298e918eeaf1ae72e6b257016>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 270 contributors in alphabetic order:

Aana Rivlin; adam maire; Aditya Srinivasan; Adrian Boyle; Ainars Zarins; Alain Bidart; aLEJANDRO sANCHEZ; Alexander Hagge; Alex Cowan; Alex Sagan; Alicia Jackson; Ali Liddle; Alisa Schulman-Janiger (California Killer Whale Project); Anand P Kruttiventi; Andrew Fischer; Andrew Peacock; Andrew Thompson; Anita Boerefijn; Anna Astafurova; Anne Meagher; Annette Bombosch; Antarctica21; Antoine Viot; Aurora Expeditions Greg Mortimer; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; BabzRobinson; Bark EUROPA; barry lynam; Ben Wallis; Berit Solstad; Brent Howard; Bryan McDonald; Byron Elvin Berger; Callie; Camilo Rada; Carina Gsottbauer; Carlos Greer; Carlos Martins; Carmel Eve; Cees Tineke; Celia Eardley; Charlotte Kirchner; Chiyo Imai Rowe; Christa Jöckel; Christian Engelke; Christian Wegener; Cindy Marple; Cindy Miller Hopkins; Clark Kelly; Claudia Roedel; Claudia Schmidt; Conor Ryan; Cottele Benny; Craig Pearce; Crawford Anderson; Dale Frink; Dan Brown; Dani Abras; Daniëlla van Broeck; Daniel Scarparolo; Darryl Ryan; Dave Katz; Denise ramirez; Dennis Greenhill; Doug Cheeseman - †; Doug Hattaway; Dr. Johannes Meiler; Dr. med Hartmut Bombosch; Duane Griffin; Duncan Jones; Elaine Reynolds; Emanuele Kuhn; Emma Collins; Eric Austin Yee; Eric Crockwell; Evelien Haels; Ezra Siegel; Fabienne+Steffen; Fanny Adomat; Franco Busetti; Frank Clark; Frank Tetreault; G Adventures Expedition Team; GAYLENE F. CHARTIER; Genna Roland; Gerald Smith; gp; Graeme Wilson; Gregory Roden; Greg Pearson; Haley Saxe; Hannah Lawson; Hannah Wirtshafter; happywhalessab; Heidi Krajewsky; Heike Dietzmann; Inia; James D Smith; James F C Hyde IV; James Moore; Jamie Coleman; Jared Funderburk; Javier Cotin; Jean-Denis Gagnon; Jeff Reynolds; Jeremy Llewelyn; Jerry Waldfogel; Jim Spiegel; Jim Wilson; JoAnn Riley; Jody Elliott; Joel Moore; Jo Feldman; John J King II; John Rogers; John Wills; Jon Deeprose; Julia; Justin Ianelli; Kami Banko; Kate Curry; Kathryn Clouston; Katlyn Taylor; Kelly Serr; Kendra Chittenden; Kevin Caughlin; Kevin Elsby; Kimberly Nesbitt; Kristin Koga; Kurt Eddington; Kurtis Randall; Kurt Liewer; Kylie Jones; Lancy Cheng; Laura K.O. Smith; Lauren koenig; Lawrence Troup; Lida pimper; Lisa Baldwin; Lorena Esteves; Lynette Spence; Madalena; Maddison Clare; Madoc Troup; Marcus Bergström; Maria Laura Marcias; Marian Herz; Mariela Cornejo; Marilia Olio; Mario; Mark Crowe; Mark Harris; Mark Smith; Martin Brooks; Martin Pögelt; Martin Renner; Mary La Creta; Marzena Rolka; Mason Hu; Matthew Greene; Megan Hall; Meike Sjoer; Melanie Glaubitz; Merel Dalebout; Michael Jackson; Michael Lewis; Michelle LaRue; Michelle Lim; Mike Greenfelder; Mike Khusid; Millie Mannering; MS Fram; MS Fridtjof Nansen; MS Seaventure citizen science; MV Hondius; Nadine Habib; Nathan Kelley; Nathan Small; Neeta Moonka; Neil C Harris; Nick Hilton; Nicola Silver; Nicolas PANIER; Nicole Janinhoff; Nigel Milius; Olga B.; Olivier Blaud; Ortelius; Paayal Desai; Pamela Le Noury; Patrick Dowd; perennec thierry; Per Nikolaj Bukh; Peter Amster; Petra Glardon; Petra Stolz; Philip Stone; Philip van Dueren; Phillip Hunter; Phil Schultz; photo contributor January 2018; Pippa Low; Plancius; Polar Latitudes Citizen Scientists; rachelle mackintosh; Raghavan Nair; Ramon Lucas; Régis PERDRIAT; Rémi Bigonneau; Rhiannon Craig; Richard Gamertsfelder; Richard White; Riki Meier; Robert Matthews; Robert Rolley; Rod Long; Rodney Dillman; saffron mali lal; Sam Liscoe; Sandra Walser; Sandy Mendel; Santiago Imberti; Sarah Buttenshaw; Sarah Kather; Sarah Keenan; Sara Jenner; Sari Turunen; Sean Neilson; Sebastian Matias Lescano; shijo jose; SH Minerva - Swan Hellenic; SH Vega - Swan Hellenic; Simon Heyes; Simon Hook; Simon van D; Sinead O'Flaherty; Sonia Pazos de Diego; Stefan Bernhard; Steffo Polar; Stephanie Newkirk; Stephanie Webb; Steph &amp; Oli Prince; steve; Steve Bariletto; Susanna Elo; Svenja Stoehr; Ted Cheeseman; Tess Hudson; tex texin; Therese Horntrich; Thibaud SCOTTI; Thomas Mitchell; Tiffany Zamolsky; Tim Kilbride; Tim Martin; Timo Hecken; Tobias Brehm; Toby Dickson; Todd Thoman; Todd Weisbrot; Tony Jagodnik; Tracey Warburton; Vacheremi; Valerie Bronckers; Valérie Vogelsanger; Vicki Beaver; Wang Xiaogang; Wilfried Schnessl; Yongjie Chen; Zubin Daruwala""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
