    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """The dataset includes age- and length-based catch per unit effort data for commercial fish species collected during the Scottish West Coast Survey. 

The Quarter 1 Scottish Groundfish survey started in 1981 and was initially intended to cover the fishing grounds on the continental shelf to the west of Scotland; in 1996 the survey area was extended to include the northern Irish Sea.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Commercial fisheries, Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Scottish West Coast Survey for commercial fish species" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/52b4a965-669d-4c5e-b564-326022a1c064> ;
.

