    ecsummary:keywords "Beam trawlers, Benthos, Biogenic sedimentary structures, Demersal fisheries, Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Trophic interactions at the sediment-water interface: effect of beam-trawling on Lanice and associated fauna - partly Westbanks" ;
