<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:2f670708372e2d5e34b2ef998d505d4d487a0ef1>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 29 contributors in alphabetic order:

Ainars Zarins; Andrew Thompson; Annick Morgenthaler; Antoine Viot; Conor Ryan; Frances Housdon; Heidi Krajewsky; Joel Moore; Kevin Elsby; Kimberly Nielsen; Kitty Swanson; Maria Laura Marcias; Marilia Olio; Mike Greenfelder; Nikki; Patagonia Azul; Peter Clement; Philip Stone; Polar Latitudes Citizen Scientists; Raghavan Nair; Régis PERDRIAT; SH Minerva - Swan Hellenic; SH Vega - Swan Hellenic; steve; Svenja Stoehr; Tiffany Stoddart; Timo Hecken; Tobias Brehm; Vicki Beaver""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Sei whale in South Atlantic Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/f18fd24a-a6e1-447c-98c6-98116ab69d07> ;
.

