<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:2f6f66f21e491407f057a0e01a34aeafb7d01b5b>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Este recurso contiene información de 113 ejemplares del coral Favia fragum, que fueron colectados y posteriormente cultivados para su estudio. Adicionalmente, contiene la información de 4 fragmentos de la esponja Amphimedon viridis, 1 fragmento de la esponja Amphimedon compressa y 2 fragmentos de la esponja Aplysina cauliformis.
Las colectas fueron realizadas en el marco del proyecto "Evaluación del efecto de esponjas arrecifales en el asentamiento larval de corales escleractinios", durante los 2020 y 2021 en la zona del Rodadero, en Santa Marta.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Reclutamiento, Asentamiento, Plánula, Corales, Esponjas, SIB_MARINO, PERMISO_COLECTA, Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Evaluación del efecto de esponjas arrecifales en el asentamiento larval de corales escleractinios" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/1a42b0c7-e99c-4510-8cbb-25a82dac09e4> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:2f71b7beb4b5a59ffe458a7b853db53757ddf914>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Informe sobre los resultados de la Expedición Providencia I, realizada por el Instituto de Investigaciones Marinas y Costeras \"José Benito Vives de Andréis\" (INVEMAR) en las Islas de Providencia y Santa Catalina, Caribe colombiano. Se exploraron diversos ambientes como manglares, areas coralinas, fondos blandos y litorales rocosos; donde se recolectaron organismos pertenecientes a los taxa Porifera, Echinodermata, Crustacea, Mollusca, Polychaeta y Chordata.  Se presentan los 568 registros provenientes de esta expedición." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Polychaeta, Porifera, Crustacea, Echinodermata, Chordata, Mollusca, Expedición, INVEMAR, Caribe colombiano, Colombia, Providencia, San Andrés, Santa Catalina, Taxonomía, Inventario, biodiversidad, Makuriwa., Occurrence, Specimen" ;
    ecsummary:name "Expedición Providencia I - INVEMAR" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/0f17131c-6dad-43da-a559-fa009fdc3c54> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:2f7cebfe64ed55976fe7b97429df7e09806bdc07>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """At Macquarie Island 1000 seals were weighed per annum between 1993-2003 at birth and individually marked with two plastic flipper tags in the inter-digital webbing of their hind flippers. These tagged seals were weighed again at weaning, when length, girth, fat depth, and flipper measurements were made. Three weeks after weaning 2000 seals were permanently and individually marked by hot-iron branding. Recaptures and re-weighing of these known aged individuals were used to calculate growth and age-specific survival of the seals.
Similar data were collected from elephant seals between 1950 and 1965 when seals were individually marked by hot-iron branding. Mark-recapture data from these cohorts were used to assess the demography of the declining population. Length and mass data were also collected for these cohorts and were used, for the first time, to assess the growth of individual seals without killing them.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Elephant Seal Sightings, Macquarie Island" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/267a89f6-e30c-4394-8253-5f4630b24a4a> ;
.

