Purpose:
CalCurCEAS = California Current Cetacean and Ecosystem Assessment Survey.
Objective: estimate population size and describe distributions for cetaceans in the California Current.
Vessel: Ocean Starr (chartered vessel, formerly the NOAA Ship David Starr Jordan).
Study area: waters off contiguous U.S. West Coast

