<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:32dee4f7008135e0e671741ef4fe94661f5bd9c0>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 74 contributors in alphabetic order:

Alexa Kershaw; Allie Smith; Annette Bombosch; Anton Chaiko; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; bev dant; Bjarki; Bob Schafer; Caitlin Fitzmaurice; Caroline Lagier; Catherine MacRae; Cees Tineke; Christian Engelke; Claudia Wagner; Conor Ryan; Corinne Eichler; Dale Frink; Dan Harville; De Wulf Maurina (maluga); Dominique Gallo; Duncan; Edy Mercuriali; Em Dueck; Emma Fowler; Emma Lever; Espaço Talassa; Franck Hollander; Harold Moses; Heidi Krajewsky; Holly Morgan-Wynne; Jack Digman; Jamie Coleman; Jennifer Stoudt; John House; Joy van der Beek; Julie Fesquet; Kari Heistad; Kathie Rokita; Kerstin Langenberger; Lars Maltha Rasmussen; Lobosonda; Maddy Montgomery; Madelon Rosenplänter; Margot Sib; Marilia Olio; Matthias De Kimpe; Max Block; Melissa Martel ROMM; Mella Re; Michel Moisan; Mitch Doucet; MS Fridtjof Nansen; Nicolas PANIER; Norbert; Patrick Chauvet; Paul Spillmann; Per Nikolaj Bukh; Raimondeau; Rita Da Costa Leitão; Rory Jackson West Cork Ocean Tours; Samantha Coppola; Sandrine Papias; Sara Franson; Sarah Kather; Sea Fever Productions; Simon Gregory; Stephen Tattersall; steve; Ted Cheeseman; Theo Vickers; Tianshuo Wang; Tobias Brehm; Tyler Robbins; Warren Zimmer""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Fin whale in North Atlantic Ocean" ;
