<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:3c74cae95090665263997b7cf45832d97b0eb43a>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
University of North Carolina, Wilmington

Dataset credits:
William A. McLellan, University of North Carolina Wilmington

Supplemental information:
[2020-10-01] The following invalid species names were corrected according to the Integrated Taxonomic Information System (ITIS).
Physeter catodon (180489) =&gt; Physeter macrocephalus (180488)


[2017-03-28] Two sighting records were updated with more accurate species identification:
2011-10-25 11:40 Ziphius to Ziphius cavirostris
2012-01-31 10:42 Ziphius to Ziphius cavirostris

[2014-03-18] Sperm whale sightings were assigned an invalid scientific name (P. catodon). It is corrected to P. macrocephalus.

The original survey data are separated into two datasets, from left-side and right-side observers upon provider's request. This dataset is from the left side sightings data. The right side sightings data are available on OBIS-SEAMAP in the <a href="/datasets/detail/855">USWTR Hatteras Aerial Survey -Right side- 2011-2012</a> dataset.

This dataset includes a subset of the data collection for the Hatteras Aerial surveys.
All the data of the collection are available in the following datasets including this dataset:
