<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:3d56973c9e5947fa8c2e00f6e15da16822048012>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """A new species of rock lobster, Jasus caveorum, is described from commercial catches taken on a non-emergent seamount in the eastern South Pacific Ocean. The species best fits the "frontalis subgroup" of the "lalandii group" of
Jasus lobsters. J. caveorum is most similar to J. frontalis from the eastern South Pacific, but differs clearly from that species in having very little
abdominal "squamous" sculpturing.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Specimen" ;
    ecsummary:name "Jasus caverum (Crustacea: Decapoda: Palinuridae) from the eastern South Pacific Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/7f683b71-2d9c-440b-b9ac-eb41a46c1535> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:3d64d237b7ba1d16d84b2afa2de564ff14201d30>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """From 2010 -2013 marine fish specimens were collected from local fish market and fish landing station all around Mauritius mainland. For each specimen collected, the morphometric data as well as the sampling location and date of collection were recorded. Each specimen was tagged with a unique identification number and photographed. Tissue samples were dissected from the body muscle for DNA extraction.  Each fish specimen was tentatively identified by an ichthyologist based on the morphological features. 
All vouchered specimens collected were deposited at the Mauritius Oceanography Institute and preserved in 10% formaldehyde or kept as frozen""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Specimen" ;
    ecsummary:name "Assessment of marine living resources in Mauritius: Marine commercial fish" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/d2e894a3-b5df-4c2a-a845-dcfd57192593> ;
.

