<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:42a3068de46f9b0559f565d7aaf1bb68fa3c1635>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Objective: To relate to oceanographic conditions the horizontal and vertical distribution of sea scallop larvae (Placopecten magellanicus) in the Canadian Gulf of Maine area (Bay of Fundy, western Scotian Shelf and Georges Bank)

Records in this dataset were digitized as part of an ongoing data recovery activity. Version 1 of the dataset contains counts of larvae per sample for cruises conducted in 1984. Abundance information (#/m3) is not included in this version. Records indicate the number of individual scallop larvae sized but these measurements are not included in this version.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "DFO-Maritimes: Planktonic sea scallop larvae in the Canadian Gulf of Maine: Distribution and abundance data 1984-1988." ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/98b326d9-78c0-40c5-82e1-467dcf4cdca9> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:42a83fcf45da7eef31c1552432bfb825a5d29130>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """This dataset represents a literature study on the distribution of marcoalgae in Antarctic and Sub-Antarctic waters. Dataset supplied in the framework of the SCAR Biogeographic Atlas of the Southern Ocean (BASO).

The Biogeographic Atlas of the Southern Ocean is a collection of representative maps and syntheses on the distribution of the Southern Ocean organisms, providing a general overview of the biogeography of the Southern Ocean (s.l.) and a benchmark of current biogeographic knowledge at the end of the Census of Antarctic Marine Life. This updates the well-known and useful but largely outdated biogeographic Folios of the Antarctic Map Folio Series (American Geographical Society).

This dataset contains species records of macro algae from the Southern Ocean (locations below 40°S) reported in 72 publications published between 1890 and 2011.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Macroalgae, SCAR-MARBIN, BASO, CAML, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "SCAR Biogeographic Atlas of the Southern Ocean - macroalgae - Data" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/2b509668-d16b-4c59-9548-f2b00ac50216> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:42a84622f953acc79c82bcf4289c228d71f1b505>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
