<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:493ff8c48637212d2a3098ed5aafbc7b4add1b7c>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Abstract:
The data in this dataset represent sightings that occurred during nearshore humpback whale monitoring beginning in 
January 2015 through May 2019 off the coast of Virginia Beach, VA. Non-systematic vessel trackline data for each season 
is included in layers separated  for 5 seasons of effort (2015, 2015/2016, 2016/2017, 2017/2018, 2018/2019). Work was 
performed under HDR task orders CTO 54, TO 33, 17F4013, and 19F4005 (IDIQ contract awards N62470-10-D-3011 and N62470-
15-8006, NAVFAC LANT).

Supplemental information:
[2020-06-05] Data in 2017-2018 and 2018-2019 were added.
[2020-01-28] Data of season 2 (TO13; Dec2015-May2016) and 
season 3 (TO33; Nov2016-Mar2017) were added.

Sightings and effort data were entered and organized in 
this geodatabase by HDR. Source data was provided by HDR 
under the MSM IDIQ contract. Sighting locations represent 
actual animal locations. Sightings and effort data for 
this project were collected using a prototype collection 
application. Because this application used a different 
database structure, there are no environmentals associated 
with the effort tracks.

Survey tracklines (aggregated over time) are available 
online and included in a downloadable zip file (shapefile 
format).""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Navy project,Marine Animal Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Sea turtles,Visual Sighting,Vessel, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "VACAPES Vessel Nearshore Humpback Whale Monitoring 2015-2019" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/d9ad033c-9597-495c-a84a-9c5b170f2519> ;
.

