<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:4a54f0be2fdd51571a79a2589bedc1160fbd7ea2>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Historic field reports and other primary literature were re-examined and intrepreted into a consistent format for an analysis of the Southern Giant Petrel Macronetes giganteus census data within the Australian Antarctic Territory. Population data has been forwarded to Agreement on the Conservation of Albatrosses and Petrels (ACAP) for their species assessments." ;
