<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:4b20c6766211b11a6d6254c31b09e90ce4d32d18>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 59 contributors in alphabetic order:

Adrian Boyle; Alain Bidart; Alma Rocio Arechiga Munoz; Andrew Peacock; ANGEL SOLE; Arthur Laux; Carlos Navarro; Christian; Christian Engelke; Christina Eland; Cuiziy_Z; Dominik Thamm; Eckhard; Greta Henderson; Gwenn; happywhalessab; Hazel Pittwood; Ian Mears; ian roberts; Jack Digman; Jamie Coleman; Javier Cotin; Jeannine Winkel; Joanna Clegg; Joyce Bosch; Katherine Knight; Kelly Magnuson; Loes de Heus; Lomvi; Manuela Nemela; Marc Schmitt; Marian Herz; Marta Morera; Martin Kemper; Michelle van Dijk; Mirko Reichert; MS Maud; MS Otto Sverdrup; MV Hondius; Nacho Oria; Natascha Klein; Nick Homer; Nikki; Norbert Wittke; Olaf Pignataro; Oliver Gérard; Oliver Vossen; Pamela Le Noury; Peter Alex Wainwright; Richard Lovelock; SarahCollitt; Sea Fever Productions; shiqi HE; Steffen Biersack; Steffen Oehme; steve; Thomas Kraemer; Timothy Burkard; Virginia Bria""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Killer whale in Arctic Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/85a55afa-8057-4019-8b43-93ed063d66be> ;
.

