Supplemental information:
[2019-07-29] Renamed from "UNCW &amp; VAQS Patuxent Aerial Survey - Left side - 2017" upon to the provider's request.

The original survey data are separated into two datasets, from left-side and right-side observers upon provider's request. This dataset is from the left side sighting data. The right side sighting data are available on OBIS-SEAMAP in the <a href="/datasets/detail/1652">UNCW PAX Aerial Survey - Left side - 2017</a> dataset.

