Abstract:
Features in this feature class represent animal sightings that occurred during aerial monitoring surveys for marine mammals performed from 2011-2012 in the SOCAL Range Complex. Survey dates are 14-18 February 2011; 30-31 March and 01 April 2011; 12-20 April 2011; 09-14 May 2011; 30-31 January and 01-05 February 2012; 13-15 March 2012; and 28-30 May and 01 April 2012. Work was performed under HDR task orders FZN1, FZN2, and KB04 (IDIQ contract award N62470-10-D-3011, NAVFAC LANT).""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Southern California Range Complex,Marine Animal Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Visual Sighting,Aircraft, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "SOCAL KB04, FZN1, FZN2 Marine Mammal Aerial Monitoring 2011-2012" ;
