<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:5248ee7f82ba4e09dce70890345ba1c6968aedc9>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """The dataset contains information on specimens of Southern Ocean Pycnogonida (Arthropoda), that were collected from 10 different research cruises, spanning 13 years. The individual aims and objectives of each cruise can be found in their cruise reports. The specimens have been collated into a single dataset, forming the basis of J Maxwell’s PhD. The dataset will be used to investigate the community structure of Antarctic pycnogonids and the factors which influence its composition.
This dataset is associated with the data paper "Sea spiders (Arthropoda, Pycnogonida) from ten recent research expeditions to the Antarctic Peninsula, Scotia Arc and Weddell Sea - data” (Maxwell et al., 2022) It contains complementary data, additional details, and supplementary information that expand upon the research presented in the referenced data paper. Researchers can use this dataset to delve deeper into the findings and conduct further analyses.
This dataset is published by SCAR-AntOBIS under the license CC-BY 4.0. Please follow the guidelines from the SCAR Data Policy (SCAR, 2023) when using the data. Please contact us via the contact information provided in the metadata or via data-biodiversity-aq@naturalsciences.be for any inquiry about this dataset. Issues with dataset can be reported at https://github.com/biodiversity-aq/data-publication/""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Specimen, ARTHROPODS, OCEAN" ;
    ecsummary:name "Sea spiders (Arthropoda, Pycnogonida) from ten recent research expeditions to the Antarctic Peninsula, Scotia Arc and Weddell Sea - data" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/5080b123-3bcf-4be9-85cd-39eb81940fb1> ;
.

