<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:5a4b56a5cec45e04f9537ea6346e844838d93b67>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Smultea Environmental Sciences, LLC

Dataset credits:
