Abstract:
Features in this feature class represent the 2010 records from all animal sightings that occurred during aerial monitoring surveys for marine mammals performed from 2010-2012 in the SOCAL Range Complex.

Supplemental information:
Sighting locations occur along survey tracklines, and do not represent  actual animal locations.

Sightings that occurred off the tracklines were considered opportunistic sightings made during opportunistic effort. 

The 2011-12 records are registered in <a href="http://seamap.env.duke.edu/dataset/1423">SOCAL Marine Mammal Aerial Monitoring 2011-2012</a>""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Southern California Range Complex,Marine Animal Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Visual Sighting,Aircraft, Observation, Occurrence" ;
