There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 17 contributors in alphabetic order:

Ann; Carey Bergman; Christian Harvey; Emily Durand; Gert van der Heide; Joshua Meza-Fidalgo; Katie Markey; Kimberly Nesbitt; Liam Ragan; Marilia Olio; Mary Wholey; Max Block; Nico Heyning; Nicole Webster; Sara Franson; Sarah Hauser; Ted Cheeseman""" ;
