    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This is a historical dataset that was published in 1936 by H. Helfer and concerns of the faunistic report on the Pantopoda collected during the floristical and faunistical survey of Adolf Steuer on the coasts near Alexandria mainly with the vessel “El Hoot”. This dataset covers the time span of 14/10/1933 to 15/11/1933 and contains occurrence data of Pantopoda in the coasts of Alexandria, Egypt. The dataset contains also informations about individual counts, sex and lifestage. The digitization of this dataset was done by LifewatchGreece team." ;
