<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:613795266bdc3c6e707c958bd7a580ca9173e536>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Records collected by Birds Australia between 1977 and 1981, each survey was ascribed to a grid with the coords given as the central point. Grids size varied, with most being 10-minute grids or 1-degree grids.
This dataset is a subset of marine species downloaded from ALA https://collections.ala.org.au/public/show/dr571 on 2020-07-14. Many records have missing dates but the data has been collected between 1976 and 1984.""" ;
