Records provided by Australian National Wildlife Collection, accessed through Atlas of Living Australia website. Occurrence download at http://biocache.ala.org.au/occurrences/search?&amp;q=data_resource_uid%3Adr341&amp;fq=species_habitats%3A%22Marine%22 accessed on Fri Mar 10 09:40:03 UTC 2017. Species were matched to the LSID from WoRMS and recorded in the scientificnameId field. The 2667 records with basisofrecord set as 'MaterialSample' have been changed to 'PreservedSpecimen'""" ;
