<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:650214aff83af697a04dfbec8ce8ceb704780a9b>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Whale Watch Azores

Dataset credits:
Whale Watch Azores

Abstract:
Seven Bryde's whales, Balaenoptera brydei, were seen several times by whale watching boats around Faial and Pico Islands, Azores. They were observed from the beginning of July until the end of August. A mother/calf pair was the most frequently observed.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Marine Animal Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Visual Sighting,Vessel, Observation, Occurrence" ;
