<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:70e1cf361af36858705808743a2c071380320d5e>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This dataset describes the abyssal megafaunal annelid morphotypes observed during the two ABYSSLINE cruises (AB01/MV1313 - 2013 and AB02/TN319 - 2015) to the UKSRL polymetallic-nodule exploration contract area (UK-1) and the site EPIRB (~250 km east of the UK-1 area) in the Clarion-Clipperton Zone in the Pacific Ocean. These megafaunal annelids were recorded using ROV and AUV. There appear to be at least 5 distinct morphospecies identified by imagery. This dataset is from the paper: Amon D, Ziegler A, Drazen J, Grischenko A, Leitner A, Lindsay D, Voight J, Wicksten M, Young C, Smith C (2017) Megafauna of the UKSRL exploration contract area and eastern Clarion-Clipperton Zone in the Pacific Ocean: Annelida, Arthropoda, Bryozoa, Chordata, Ctenophora, Mollusca. Biodiversity Data Journal 5: e14598. https://doi.org/10.3897/BDJ.5.e14598" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence; Deep-sea mining; Polymetallic nodule; Clarion-Clipperton Zone; megafauna; Ctenophora" ;
    ecsummary:name "ABYSSLINE UKSRL Contract Area CCZ Megafauna 2013-2015: Ctenophora" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/b9786aec-1ac1-4803-b8d5-50ca7b9e87b4> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:70e474df53cffa3c050b41f7cd0c360b86978f9e>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Abstract:
Records in 2013 represent animal sightings that occurred during two aerial surveys for marine mammals performed March-July 2013 in the SOCAL Range Complex. Survey dates are 25-30 March 2013, 22-26 May 2013, and 24-29 July 2013. Work was performed under HDR task order FZN4 (IDIQ contract award N62470-10-D-3011, NAVFAC LANT).""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Southern California Range Complex,Marine Animal Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Visual Sighting,Aircraft, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "SOCAL FZN4 Marine Mammal Aerial Monitoring 2013" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/419f84d6-c6b5-4fd4-82ee-099dc2a92788> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:70e557c8f6346234cb16b1208286eb071b305102>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """In 2015/2016, anomalous sea temperatures associated with the El Nino period triggered a pan-tropical episode of coral bleaching which included the Kimberleys. To investigate the effect of this bleaching event, Intertidal and subtidal surveys were conducted at 11 sites within the Bonaparte Archipelago at two platform reefs and five fringing reefs from September 16 to 21, 2016. Subtidal sites were surveyed on SCUBA at 12 m depth. Mid-to-lower littoral reef flats were surveyed by reef walking at low tide.
Data from cited paper and accessed on 2022-06-20""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Samplingevent" ;
    ecsummary:name "A tropical Australian refuge for photosymbiotic benthic fauna, Bonaparte Archipelago, Western Australia (2016)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/1c9e29d9-618f-406c-899a-953c22c36ea8> ;
.

