There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 18 contributors in alphabetic order:

Charlotte Kirchner; Conor Ryan; Cora Zeng; Elizabeth Zwamborn; Javier Cotin; Joel Moore; John House; Kimberly Nesbitt; Kristy King; Lottie Eastwood; Madalena; Marijke Nita de Boer; MS Fridtjof Nansen; OSI Cetis; Phillippa Tichotova; Sabine+Ulf; Ted Keyel; Veronika Doppelreiter""" ;
