<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:7e84b9be88e60d3816520123ac4b65fd77ff8825>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "The first phase of the Monitoring and Follow-up Plan within the framework of the SUFAZ project, corresponding to the BEFORE component of the B-BACI design. This project was developed in the Venezuelan Golf (Falcon Sate) and includes the study of the seabed and water quality, as well as the study of artisanal fisheries with experimental fishing and estimation of biological-fishing parameters in landings within the area of influence of Section D (Río Seco-Tiguadare). Characterize the fishing resources, the benthic communities, the planktonic communities (phyto-, zoo- and ichthyoplankton). The two survey campaigns were carried out from June 19 to 21 and from September 05 to 06, 2012." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Caribe Sur, BID-CA2020-025-NAC" ;
    ecsummary:name "Componentes biológicos estudiados en el área de influencia del tramo D, poliducto SUFAZ. La primera fase del Plan de Monitoreo y Seguimiento en el marco del proyecto SUFAZ" ;
