Abstract:
Cetaceans' strandings along Bulgarian Black Sea coast compiled and recorded within Green Balkans NGO's Cetacean Monitoring and Conservation Program.

Purpose:
Data was collected within Green Balkans NGO's Cetacean Monitoring and Conservation Program and aims to monitor species composition and temporal and spatial trends in stranded cetaceans along Bulgarian coast.

Supplemental information:
[2023-01-17] Data since 2011 were added.
Time was not provided and "00:00:00" was used.
Species column shows the scientific name at the species level. Actual identification should be at the subspecies level if possible.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Land-based,Sightings,Stranding, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Green Balkans NGO's cetacean strandings on the Bulgarian Black Sea coast" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
