There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 78 contributors in alphabetic order:

adam maire; Alain Bidart; alena antonova; Alicia Jackson; Andrew Thompson; Annette Bombosch; Antoine Viot; Antony Jinman; Berit Solstad; Brian Dolan; BRUNIER Serge; Carlos Martins; Christina Huang; Conor Ryan; Crawford Anderson; Croft@Family; Cyril VATHELET; David Gamba; Dmitrii Kiselev; Duncan Jones; Eleuthera du Breuil; Fanny; Frank Tetreault; Hannah B; Hannah Lawson; Heidi Krajewsky; HE Yu; Javier Cotin; Jeff Thiemann; Jennifer Perdoch; Julie Daltrey; Kevin Walker; Kimberly Nesbitt; Kitty Swanson; Kurtis Randall; Madoc Troup; Maria Laura Marcias; Marian Herz; Marilia Olio; Mark Smith; Matthew Chadwick; Mette Hansen; Michelle LaRue; MS Fridtjof Nansen; MV Hondius; NOEL DEVERY; Oana Claudia Dinescu; Olivier Blaud; Ortelius; Pamela Le Noury; perennec thierry; Per Nikolaj Bukh; Philip van Dueren; Pippa Low; Plancius; Ramona D.; Régis PERDRIAT; Rémi Bigonneau; Robert Parker; Sam Claxton; Sarah Kather; Sarah Keenan; Sara Jenner; Sebastian Shaw; Shirley; SH Minerva - Swan Hellenic; SH Vega - Swan Hellenic; Stefan Bernhard; steve; Svenja Stoehr; Ted Cheeseman; Tiffany Zamolsky; Tobias Brehm; Toby Dickson; Tony Ernst; Vadym Tkachenko; Vicki Beaver; Yongjie Chen""" ;
