<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:911e0f6a9a597e9f6d016f6d4823216f43a9d201>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This resource contains a list of taxa associated with the Cobscook Bay inventory (Trott 2004), a historical checklist that documents species of macroinvertebrates found in Cobscook Bay, Maine. The checklist is based on collection records spanning the past 162 years. Information was compiled from published literature, museum collection records, electronic databases, graduate students theses, and species collection lists from invertebrate zoologists." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Cobscook Bay Inventory: A Historical Checklist of Marine Invertebrates Spanning 162 Years (1843 - 2005)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/cfdfb895-2d65-47ed-bb2e-827cad0350af> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:913f4848c3b91e597ee422d62473c9555ab10cfc>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Dataset containing 247 records of occurrence of 26 species of decapod crustaceans distributed on the Southern Atlantic Patagonian continental shelf and slope, and on the Burdwood Bank. This dataset lists the specimens captured in different scientific cruises done between 2009 and 2017. Sampling were done with trawling benthic nets: 11 tows in 2009 (December); 17 in 2012 (April); 2 in 2013 (March); 20 in 2016 (26March-25April) and 25 in 2017 (22April-12May)	. All samplings were done with the RV Puerto Deseado. Depth range of samples is 27-785 m." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, marine invertebrates, decapod crustaceans, crabs, hermit-crabs; shrimps;  Patagonia Argentina, subantarctic." ;
    ecsummary:name "Decapod crustaceans of the Burdwood Bank and adjacent region" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/dcb26bfb-e18e-4672-a7ef-07e6f192ed81> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:91457e0aa6ba4321c3c252a11d2e643dcda7152d>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 1 contributors in alphabetic order:

Joachim Bertrands""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Dwarf sperm whale in North Pacific Ocean" ;
