<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:91b26b7054c3a541aa107abe79e40ac99948a2e1>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Abstract:
Two aerial marine species monitoring survey events occurred during 19 through 22 October 2011 and 07 through 16 October 2012 for an Airborne Mine Neutralization System (AMNS) live-inert explosive research, development, test, and evaluation (RDT&amp;E) event. These surveys were conducted off the west coast of Florida in
the Naval Surface Warfare Center Panama City Division (NSWC PCD) Study Area in the
Gulf of Mexico (GOM). The AMNS is a mine countermeasures device that includes an
explosive charge.

Purpose:
U.S. Navy protected marine species monitoring during AMNS explosives test event

Supplemental information:
References will be available when they are ready.
All the US Navy-funded survey datasets are found in the <a href="http://seamap.env.duke.edu/partner/NAVY">OBIS-SEAMAP US Navy</a> page.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Navy project,Aircraft,Sightings, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Sightings for Airborne Mine Neutralization System Aerial Monitoring in the NSWC PCD Study Area from October 2011, 2012" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/fbaa637c-cf4a-4ad4-b6d2-a420ffadd238> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:91b5d7ed9352007b20a8c390fe64c61ba052dc95>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "The data was collected yearly by the LBMM team (https://lbmm.ufsc.br/), from 2007 to 2022. Dataset includes fish species, size and abundance recorded at 40 m² (20 × 2 m) belt transects at nine locations along the Santa Catarina state coastal area. Transects were laid at different depths at approximately 5 m intervals according to local maximum depths, which ranged from 1 to 25 m. This dataset, named TimeFISH, was recently published by Quimbayo et al. (2023)." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Samplingevent, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "ReefSYN | Standardized datasets of Brazilian reef diversity in space and time - Dataset VI: Santa Catarina reef fish monitoring" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/4d8f1db5-182b-40a0-b73d-edd8edd50469> ;
.

