<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:9522946b1b49104674642aff8112208426a63afd>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 163 contributors in alphabetic order:

Aaron Taylor; Adrian Bell; Alan Straton; Alexander Vogel; Alex Bradshaw; alex krowiak; Alex Vogel; Alfred John Burgess; Andy Gilbert; Angie Gullan; Anne McGregor; Anthony McArdle; Arthur Teo; Ashleigh Peters; Atlantine Boggio-Pasqua; Atzmon Dagan; Baptiste N; Benjamin Wambergue; BERDNIKOVA; Bernard Ash; Berno Phillipson; Bethany Hannah Carmody; Bianca Tree; Brooke Lloyd; Caroline LAURENT; Cees Tineke; Centre for Whale Research; Centre for Whale Research Western Australia; Cétamada; Ceta'Maore; Chauvin Anaelle; chengzhang; Chiara; Christine Olson; Conor Ryan; Coralee Askew; Danielle Conry; David Donnelly; Deb Philipps; Deep Voice; Devienne Gilles; Dmitry Evseev; Dominik Dietrich; Don Marx; Doriane; Dot Robertson; Dustin; Eddy Thys; Ed Tissink; Eileen Goersdorf; Elisabeth Rhodes; Elisa Seyboth; Els Vermeulen; Emma Sharp; Esther van der Stappen; Ethan Hollowell; Eulalia Busquets; Evan T; Fabio picinato; Fontaine Xavier; Frank Eckler; Gabrielle Lui; Gary Allport; Gill Braulik; Giulia; Grace Russell; Graeme Hillary; Graham Downer; Hayley Islip; Hayley Newell; Jaden Orli; Jan Hunter; Jasmin Wulf; Jason turl; Jeffrey Garriock; Jennifer Keeping; Jesse cook; Johannes Pikaan; Jordan Breslin; Karen Whelan; Ken Finlay; Lana Barteneva; Lena Menzel; Libu Cyprien; Linda Heads; Linda Horton; Linda Ness; Lucas Facchinetti; Luke Manson; Machi Yoshida; Madeleine Brasier; Madeleine Mott; Maeva Terrapon; Maksim Zaitsau; Mandroso97; Mareasa Ford; Marian Herz; marine malen; Mark Brown; Marta Filippini; Martin Banks; Maureen Macdonald; Mdu Seakamela; Medina Jasar; Melanie Keyte; Melissa Nel; Michael Keogh; Michael Sheehan; Michèle Vogel; Mike Greenfelder; Mi Shell; Nakia Cullain; Noel Outtrim; Nyal Mueenuddin; Olaf Pignataro; Olivier Segers; Pamela Le Noury; Pedro Víctor Albaladejo Fresnadillo; peter allsop; Philip Milton; pia markovic; Raggy Charters; Raina Burke; Ramzy Haddad; Ricardo Rangel-Reyes; Roanna Horbelt; Robert Akester; Robin Hicks; Rodrigo A. Martinez Catalan; Rose Bilbrough; Rowan Streeter; Sarah Gower; Sarah Kather; Sarah Tranmer; Sarah Tuckfield; Sean Ward; Sherri Daniels; Shirley; Simone Eley; Simon Mahood; Stefania; Sue Holman; Susana Latorre; Suzanne Johnson; Tammy Patterson; Tamrez; Tanja; Ted Gaten; Teresa Holtmann; Terese Drummond; The Dolphin Centre; Thibaut Bouveroux; Tiffany mckenzie; trevor Kay; Vincent Quiquempois; Violaine Dulau; Wade Kevin Eastburn; Wayne Sentman; Wendy Hare; Whale Watch Western Australia; Yeon Bin Kim; Yiew Lee Siew; Zaitseva Kristina""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Humpback whale in Indian Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
