    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "CMLRE has collected various specimens from the Indian Ocean. The current dataset includes a wide range of faunal groups such as fishes, echinoderms, polychaetes, crustaceans, mollusks, and others. These specimens were collected from various cruises onboard FORV Sagar Sampada during the period of 2010-2023 and have been diligently preserved and maintained at the newly established CMLRE Referral Centre." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, IndOBIS, Indian Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:name "Voucher Specimen collections of Centre for Marine Living Resources &amp; Ecology (CMLRE), Kochi, India" ;
