    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
International Pacific Halibut Commission

Dataset credits:
IPHC Annual halibut stock assessments

Abstract:
Summary of opportunistic short-tailed albatross (<i>Phoebastria albatrus</i>) observations during IPHC stock assessment cruises in Oregon, Washington, Gulf of Alaska, Aleutians, and Bering Sea. These are continuing surveys.

Purpose:
To provide information on the seasonal and interannual distribution of the highly-endangered Short-tailed albatross population off the West Coast of North America.""" ;
