<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:99b2bcd191f7a3aff414899af42f404b80f98876>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """As part of a McGill University thesis project, grab samples were collected from two fiords on Ellesmere Island, NWT during two summer. Replicate samples were collected from various depths along a transect extending out from the shore with the objective of determining depth distributions of benthic polychaetes in the two fjords.
Version 1 of this dataset includes presence information for the dominant taxa. This information was extracted from thesis appendices (Curtis 1970). Nominal latitude and longitude coordinates have been assigned to this dataset as the exact locations where the grab samples were collected was not provided.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "McGill University: Depth distributions of benthic polychaetes in two fjords on Ellesmere Island, NWT." ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/927d909a-3357-4ad8-b3b7-87d89ee0335f> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:99b4f78f16c01e54b70f49ad4f8f6e6e4a867698>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """The Fisheries and Oceans Canada, Pacific Region Institute of Ocean Science (IOS) Zooplankton Database is a MS Access Application for data entry, storage, and retrieval of zooplankton and related data. This OBIS resource contains a small subset of species distribution records extracted from the IOS database. 


The 'Arctic pre2001' dataset contains records of zooplankton collected during IOS cruises (8770, 9207, 9324, 9470, 9526, 9924, 0022) to the arctic between 1987 to 2000. Some of the samples were collected through the ice using a collapsing  or hinged frame on a modified SCOR net the rest were vertical Bongo net hauls.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "DFO Pacific IOS zooplankton database - Zooplankton samples collected during cruises to the Canadian Arctic between 1987 and 2000" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/3e8a8d84-09c1-475f-a172-c4d69af5d2ca> ;
.

