    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "The dataset provides records of the composition and density of phytoplankton, copepods and marine cladocerans assemblage from Mochima Bay (Venezuela) during 2 days of sampling on March 2016. The six stations were located on a longitudinal transect from the inner bay to the outer marine-influenced area. In addition, measurements of water salinity and temperature were obtained." ;
