<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:9b0e8b7082ddf725d86907f82b85cf07c13a018e>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Aerial surveys of cetaceans in the Zeehan and Apollo Australian Marine Parks were conducted as part of commercial research. The surveys were conducted at an altitude of about 300 metres at a speed of approximately 130 knots along transect lines totaling 60 nautical miles using the following equipment: fixed wing aircraft, DSLR cameras fitted with 400mm lenses, binoculars,GPS and data recording applications. This data has been supplied to OBIS Australia as part of the activity permit for the survey within Australian Marine Parks.
The dataset now includes marine mammal sightings from aerial surveys conducted within the Beagle Marine Park in 2023.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Aerial surveys of cetaceans in the Zeehan, Apollo and Beagle Australian Marine Parks, Australia (2021-2023)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/bcd1417a-c05f-4495-8f79-ca6cdb691215> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:9b16aad56bf5f1447acbea26727fa3859fa3e4f6>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Outer Banks Center for Dolphin Research

Dataset credits:
Outer Banks Center for Dolphin Research

Abstract:
Data were collected through a combination of dedicated and opportunistic effort by the Outer Banks Center for Dolphin Research. Survey coverage includes sound waters adjacent to the Outer Banks of North Carolina.

Purpose:
The purpose of this study is to examine the seasonal movement patterns of bottlenose dolphins in the sounds surrounding the Outer Banks, North Carolina using photo-identification.

Supplemental information:
[2015-01-23] the data in 2013 were added on 2015-01-23.
[UPDATE] the data in 2010 through 2012 were added on 2013-02-20.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Vessels,Sightings, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Bottlenose dolphins off Outer Banks 2007-2012" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/de0023cb-9de4-4e5a-86bd-e900e400e5d2> ;
.

