<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:a2d78204d383e039094da3549830723b6073ce02>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Database containing unpublished information about the position of south Atlantic right whales (Eubalaena australis) in the Bahía Nueva (located between 42° 41’ 55’’ S - 64° 59’ 38’’ W and 42° 47´ 08´´ S - 64 ° 57´25´´ W), Puerto Madryn, Chubut, Argentina. Position of individuals in the bay were recorded by terrestrial triangulation method during August and November of 2003-2005. Samples recorded number of individuals and group composition during the breeding season." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Southern right whale, sightings, triangulation method, Eubalaena australis. Southwest Atlantic Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:name "Southern right whales distribution in Bahía Nueva, Puerto Madryn, Argentina" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/0395930d-6e69-4789-b1d6-da4445d752c3> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:a2db6c1f28197d756a5c31f9a97d0d756ffccacf>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "<p>This dataset presents abundance data of juveniles <i>Mugil liza</i> recorded in surf-zone in south Brazilian coast. The fish were collected monthly between June 2011 and May 2012 in the surf zones adjacent to the mouths of the six estuaries from 29°S, 48°W to 34°S, 53°W.</p>" ;
