    ecsummary:description "This dataset contains macrobenthos data collected in the Yellow Sea during the 11-17 November 2011. The samples were collected with a 1.5*0.5m Agassiz trawl. The mesh size of the net decreased from the largest mesh size of 2*2 cm at the mouth to the smallest of 0.7*0.7cm at the cod end." ;
