<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:ad49441f166d146d43ac3a83062e8f2914323da2>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This is a historical dataset that was published in 1936 by A. Billards and concerns of the faunistic report on the Hydroidea collected during the floristical and faunistical survey of Adolf Steuer on the coasts near Alexandria mainly with the vessel “El Hoot”. This dataset covers the time span of 2/9/1933 to 12/11/1933 and contains occurrence data of Hydroidea in the coasts of Alexandria, Egypt. The digitization of this dataset was done by LifewatchGreece team." ;
