Abstract:
In this project we try to complete our knowledge regarding post nesting migration routes and foraging grounds of Piai's Green turtles.

Supplemental information:
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/index.shtml?project_id=223">Visit STAT's project page</a> for additional information.

This dataset is a summarized representation of the telemetry locations aggregated per species per 1-degree cell.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Piai Island Green Sea Turtle Tracking (aggregated per 1-degree cell)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/1f6fa8a5-9285-4257-87b0-5ff078a8acf9> ;
