Supplemental information:
The original survey data are separated into two datasets, from left-side and right-side observers upon provider's request. This dataset is from the left side sighting data. The right side sighting data are available on OBIS-SEAMAP in the <a href="/datasets/detail/1797">UNCW PAX Aerial Survey - Left side - 2017</a> dataset.

This dataset includes a subset of the data collection for the PAX Aerial surveys.
Other data of the collection are available in the following datasets:
<a href="http://seamap.env.duke.edu/dataset/1654">UNCW PAX Aerial Survey - Right side - 2017</a>
<a href="http://seamap.env.duke.edu/dataset/1652">UNCW PAX Aerial Survey - Left side - 2017</a>
