<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:af6b8a7ea102a0a9884144ca7459cd979446b2dd>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Zooplankton was counted and identified from three sites over the 5-year period. The net used (200 microm Bongo net) was designed to catch meso-zooplankton with an integrated vertical tow through the water column. One net from each of the paired Bongo samples was analysed and the data expressed as numbers per m3. Copepods dominated the zooplankton, with other groups such as salps, krill, appendicularians, cladocerans, chaetognaths and meroplanktonic larvae being seasonally dominant." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Specimen" ;
    ecsummary:name "Zooplankton sampling in the coastal waters of south eastern Tasmania, Australia (2009-2015)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/2a93fe93-2fdc-41b3-b36a-5deb261c02db> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:af6e975178c81e7d5084147442fd766d82d7fef0>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """This resource contains species distribution records collected as part of a Marine Ecology Laboratory study on a mudflat ecosystem located at Pecks Cove in the Bay of Fundy.  This collection contains abundance (numbers per square meter) and distribution information for two benthic macroinvertebrates, the arthropod Corophium volutator and the mollusc Macoma balthica.
This OBIS resource contains a subset of the study results - for more information see Gordon et al 1980.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "DFO Maritimes: Benthic macroinvertebrates collected as part of the Pecks Cove mudflat ecosystem study" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/cc7ce2ff-17bc-4382-8c51-aefb1633cc29> ;
.

