There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 26 contributors in alphabetic order:

ANGEL SOLE; Babsi Neubarth; Carola Heiner-Braun; Chiari Massimiliano; Christian; Conor Ryan; Cuiziy_Z; Dave Teunissen; David Desaulnier; Eric Clark; Esther van der Stappen; Hannes Güdelhöfer; Jeremy Thomas; Joanna Clegg; Juan Manuel García Cambeiro; Lynn Murray; Machi Yoshida; Mark Veeken; Michel Lau; MV Hondius; Patricia Bally Triebold; Qianxin Deng; Sandra Schmidt-Bellinghoff; Simon Merz; Tammy Nicholas; Wendy Upton""" ;
