<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:b642ec10d49d93ec24f86d3e22f9d8db7d189441>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
NOAA Southeast Fisheries Science Center (SEFSC)

Dataset credits:
