    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """This voyage was used to test and refine optimal techniques to map and assess seabed habitat. The sampling locations are a number of submarine canyons and their immediately adjacent flanks on the west coast of Tasmania and east of Bass Strait.
Taxa have been matched to the World Register of Marine Species (WoRMS). Reports, metadata and other data from this voyage are at https://www.marine.csiro.au/data/trawler/survey_details,cfm?survey=SS200404""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Specimen" ;
    ecsummary:name "CSIRO, Cruise SS200404, Benthic Biodiversity, Tasmanian Coast; Bass Strait; Tasman Sea; NSW Coast, 2004" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/72f00c0d-996a-4191-8b45-e701f75da0d1> ;
