<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:bc98d5bbe3f8b98cdba1c955a292b179d081da9b>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 119 contributors in alphabetic order:

Aaron Boone; Adrian Boyle; Ana Eguiguren; Andrew Armour; Andy Wolff; ANGEL SOLE; Anna Sanchez Mora; Archipelagos Institute; Ash Clements; A&amp;W Steffen; Azores Experiences; Barry Gutradt; Bergandi; Bettina; Beverly Orthwein; Brian Burnett; Camila Alejandra Dávila Pardo; Carina Watson; Carol Irwin; Casey Perry; Catherine MacRae; Cecile Constantin; Christina Frech; Cindy Miller Hopkins; Claudio Mathis; Corinne Eichler; Cottele Benny; Cyril VATHELET; Dare Harcourt; Emer Leahy; Emilia Mussoni; Emma Lever; Eric Angel Ramos; Espaço Talassa; Ewa; Frank Wirth Pico Sport Azores; Guilherme Rodrigues Estrela; Harold Moses; Hazel Pittwood; H. Charles Foster; Heather Robinson; Henriikka Seppälä; Holly Morgan-Wynne; Ian Parsons; Isaure Michaud; James Coyer; Jeannine Winkel; Jim Wilson; Joel Moore; John Jackson; Jordan; Joshua Meza-Fidalgo; Julia Hamm; Kevin Keiser; Kirstin Jones; Leonard Hofelich; lisa fischer; Lisa Steiner; Lobosonda; Louise Steinbach; Lucile Sachot; Lynn Murray; Marilia Olio; Martina Bartolini; Martin Jamieson; Matthew Messina; Michael Jackson; Michael Scott; Milena Cuzzucoli; Molly Wallis; Mona Wong; MONICET; Mouser Williams; MS Fridtjof Nansen; MS Spitsbergen; MTurcot; mustikka; Nacho Oria; Neal Maxwell; Nicola Crouch; Nikolas Linke; Nolwenn Dameron; Ocean Missions; Oliver Boisseau; OSI Cetis; Patrick Dykstra; Patrick Groot; Paula Hoppe; Pedro Reyes-Farinas; Pernell Francis; Phillippa Tichotova; Ray Thompson; Ricardo Ventura; Rita Da Costa Leitão; Rita Ferreira; Robert Wälter; Roger ETCHEBERRY; Ruxandra Receanu; Sabine Hoek; Sabine+Ulf; Sarah Kather; Scott Davis; Seán O'Callaghan; Seraf van der Putten; Shane Gero; Sigrún Helgudóttir; SOS Dolfijn; Stephanie Suciu; steve; Steven Michael Dunn; Stian Kleiven; Tanja; Tarek Haddad; Thomas OTWAY; Tobias Brehm; Ton Knijnenburg; warre verlinde; Wim van Urk; Yves Fleuriot""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Sperm whale in North Atlantic Ocean" ;
