<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:be7220a3c317cecd139c82646db2f353f2c80b63>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 56 contributors in alphabetic order:

Adam Patton; Ahab; Alain Bidart; Allison Conlon; Alvaro Jaramillo; Amy Markowich; Andy Churn; Bill Tucker; Cees Tineke; Chris Dennis; Conor Ryan; Dale Frink; David L Smith; Deb Hooyman; Elie Vannier; Fabien Chesneau; George Hazelton; Glenda Darling; Hannah Romanowski; Helen Rijkes; Jamie Coleman; Jay Barlow; Jeremy Spencer-Cooper; Jim Wilson; Joel Moore; Joe Olson; Joshua Weil; Kelly M Coursey Gray; Kiana Viceroy; Kimberly Nesbitt; Laurie Kantor; Lesley Matthews; Lisa Menstell; Madelon Rosenplänter; Marian Herz; Marilia Olio; Mark Fiebert; Mike McDonald; Oliver Beagley; Oscar Thomas; Peter Geraerts; Randy Smith; Ricardo Matus; Richard Belbin; Ricky; Robert de PICCIOTTO; Sebastian Mayer; Shayne Lightfoot; Shota Nakagawa; Steve Magness; Suzanne Wafer; Velia Cardin; Victor Laubach; Whale Watcher; Yuan; zhangjinpeng""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Sperm whale in South Pacific Ocean" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/e1a3fcee-02f7-40d6-a22f-d93cdd52413d> ;
.

