<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c11dc931b2609ba9fce541f9763512a902b62c9b>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
