Abstract:
Data in this dataset represent animal sightings for eleven days of Navy funded small boat surveys to photograph and satellite tag marine mammal odontocetes. Surveys were conducted from 4 to 14 August 2017 off Kauai, in and around the Pacific Missile Range Facility (PMRF), within the Hawaii Range Complex (HRC). Work was performed under HDR task order KB16 (IDIQ contract award N62470-15-D-8006, NAVFACPAC).""" ;
