<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c2004b6824718a3180e12ab643faf2abf2d1aca6>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """During May and June 1965 a study was conducted on the physical, chemical and biological oceanographic conditions in Nanoose Bay. This resource contains the zooplankton observations collected as part of this study. 
Samples were collected using Clark Bumpus nets equipped with flow meters. Abundance (number per cubic meter) information is recorded in the DwC individual counts field and the units are recorded under samplesize in the dynamicProperties field""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "DFO Pacific: Zooplankton collected during an oceanographic study in Nanoose Bay, British Columbia during May and June 1965" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
