<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c3b4de6891bea1575a84a5df2919b1ef12b481a5>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """This dataset is part of a broader compilation named 'Standardized datasets of Brazilian reef diversity in space and time' created from a research network of reef scientists within several projects and collaborations and finally gathered and published by the ReefSYN group.
This dataset has been collected through the collective effort among Instituto Chico Mendes de Conservação da Biodiversidade (ICMBio), Centro de Biologia Marinha - Universidade de São Paulo (CEBIMar/USP), LECAR (http://www.lecaruff.com.br) and LBMM (https://lbmm.ufsc.br) teams.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Samplingevent, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "ReefSYN | Standardized datasets of Brazilian reef diversity in space and time - Dataset X: Alcatrazes monitoring" ;
