<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c6a62cbab3194828c95a49731a530917259af6a7>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This is an updated list including the respective synonymy, of foraminifera from the coasts of Venezuela. The compendium includes around 4,514 records for 1,035 species distributed along the Venezuelan coast, including the one corresponding to the islands. Of this total, 271 species are endemic to Venezuela. The compiled publications come from 1918 to 2021. The Rotailida, Miliolida and Textulariida groups stand out as the most important within the species composition, accumulating 84% of the total, with the other groups being Lagenida, Nodosairida, Spirilinida, Polymorphinida, Vaginulinida, Robertinida, Carterinida and Involutinida which contribute the remaining 16%." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Caribe Sur, BID-CA2020-025-NAC, Foraminifera" ;
    ecsummary:name "Diversidad de Foraminiferos en Venezuela" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/1989b957-2ef5-4402-8a58-9a72eb3cf613> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c6a74ad213235d0f216088933b18168290c7a4aa>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Information on fish species occurrence data is provided, belonging to the Terminos Lagoon coastal ecosystem, southern Gulf of Mexico, during the years 1980-1981, 1998-1999, 2010-2011, and 2016-2017. The information forms part of a compilation of four datasets mostly derived from the sampled material by the research program on tropical fishery resources of the “Instituto de Ecologia, Pesquerias y Oceanografia del Golfo de Mexico, Universidad Autonoma de Campeche (EPOMEX-UAC)”. The current dataset represents the first and most comprehensive open-access source of information corresponding to the fish assemblages occurring along the Terminos Lagoon ecosystem." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Fish occurrence, Nekton, Estuary, Species richness, Coastal lagoon, Biodiversity, Fishery resource, Gulf of Mexico" ;
    ecsummary:name "Fish occurrence data in the Terminos Lagoon, Campeche" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/cbb072de-2ee8-4b4b-8d84-f7dc48d5e39f> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c6a850c2501761d9c4cf5cbc216c4f4702510d32>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "The biodiversity and community assemblages of seagrass and sand habitats located in shallow water habitats of the Banc d’Arguin were sampled with a beach seine at 3 sites, during two sampling missions in December and April. The objectives were to test if the community assemblages in term of abundance, species diversity and assemblage structure were different between habitats, as well as the effect of the season and the site." ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Biodiversity and community assemblage of shallow habitats of the National Park of Banc d'Arguin (Mauritania): influence of habitat, season and site" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/c6fa7cf5-2c9c-4d77-b71b-9e4801e741fc> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:c6b1ebbe57d7750542c02d072c2db9d1fe7ce4c3>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "699 Registros recopilados durante las jornadas de evaluación de la abundancia de aves en tres areas marinas protegidas (nivel conservación estricta) del sistema de Parques Nacionales Naturales. El contrato fue realziado por INVEMAR en el marco del proyecto \"Diseño e implementación de un Subsistema de Áreas Marinas Protegidas en Colombia” GEF-SAMP  y ejecutado por investigadores de la Asociación CALIDRIS" ;
