    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Sampling data captured in Oceanic Exploration Research UK Seabed Resources Ltd (UKSRL) is pleased to submit this annual report on activities with respect to the Plan of Work associated with its 15-year International Seabed Authority (ISA) Exploration Licence that entered into effect on 8 February 2013. This report describes the activities of the calendar year 2014." ;
