<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:cfccc5bde5dfe98d220c204758938ef4a05185e9>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Smultea Environmental Sciences, LLC

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Supplemental information:
The sighting records in 2010 were removed and registered as a new dataset "SOCAL Marine Mammal Aerial Monitoring 2010" (http://seamap.env.duke.edu/dataset/1467) with new attributes and tracklines.""" ;
