<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:d0a00d197673656a18cc4dbe1638f81c8ab19681>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 342 contributors in alphabetic order:

adam maire; Adriana Moretta; Adrian Boyle; Adriano Adamson Paiva; Agustina Ramirez; Alain Bidart; Alan Henry; Alan Johanson; Alan Jones; Aleksandr Trach; Alexander Assis Moreira; Alexandre Piemonte; Alexandre Zerbini; Alex Vogel; Aline de Jesus Lobo; Amy Kennedy; André Soller; Andrew Macau de Lima; Andrew Thompson; Anerléia Barbosa; Anna Astafurova; Anna Belcher; Annette Bombosch; Ashley Hamilton; Aurelio Rufo; Aurora Expeditions Greg Mortimer; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; Aveline Galea; Beatriz Ribeiro; Beatriz Rosse Queiroz; Becci Jewell; Beluga Zeng; Benjamin Wambergue; BENJAMIN  WILLIAM PEARCE; Ben Osborne; Ben Phalan; BIA HETZEL; Brian Dolan; Brian Kirsch; British Antarctic Survey (BAS) research staff; Bronwen Trupp; Bruce Pailthorpe; Bruna Monteiro de Magalhães; Byron Elvin Berger; Camille De Castro; Carina Gsottbauer; Carla Fiorito; Carley Lowe; Carl Henry; Carlos Martins; Carmen; Carol; Carol Hemminger; Caroline Lupini; Carolyn Dankowski; Cecilia Facchola; César Augusto Gribaudo; Chiara Franzoni; Chris Croxson; Chris M; Chris &amp; Monique Fallows; Chris Peryer; Christian Engelke; Chris Wilkinson; Cindy Marple; Cindy Miller Hopkins; Claude Peffer; Claudia Weber-Gebert; Colleen Goujjane; Conor Ryan; Crawford Anderson; Cynthia Wilson; Daiana Paula da Silva Cabral; Dale Frink; Dani Abras; Daniela Derron; Danielle Conry; Dave de Beer; David Boyarski; David Cummings; David Hurwitz; David Pechey; David Simms; Deborah Komatsu; Declan Troy; Diana Carvalho de Freitas; Diego Menezes Marto; Dmitrii Kiselev; Dolores Muff; Dr. Johannes Meiler; Dyer Island Cruises; EcoSaber; Ecosul Turismo; Edgar Roller; Eli Konen; Elisa Seyboth; Ella Crowie; Ella Potts; Ellen Adelman; Els Vermeulen; Emily Clarke; Érika Coelho; Erika Ramos Mello; Evelien Haels; Ezra Siegel; Fabiana magon limonete; Fabiane Mota; Fabio; Felipe Buloto; Felipe Sousa Furtado; Filipe Versehgi Silva; Flávia de Paulo Daurelio; Frank Santos; Frank Tetreault; Gabi Carrera; Gabriela C Oms; Gabriela Corso da Silv