Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 147 contributors in alphabetic order:

Abhishek Gurung; Adrian Boyle; Alexandre HERBRECHT; Alice Helmer; Alicia Jackson; Allison Conlon; Amit Gupta; Angela Devaney; Anna Astafurova; Annette Bombosch; Antarctica21; Antoine Viot; Antony Jinman; Asher Levi; Aurora Expeditions Greg Mortimer; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; Bark EUROPA; Berit Solstad; Bob Perchonok; Brendan Burke; Brent Howard; Brian Dolan; Bryan McDonald; Camilla Manson; Caroline Conver; Carolyn Peterson; Charlotte Commons; Chauvin Anaelle; Christian Engelke; D Cavagnac; Deborah Humphreville; Diana Stamberga; Donna L. West; Doug Cheeseman - †; Dr. med Hartmut Bombosch; Duane 'Mike' Smith; Emilie Walker; Endymion ervin tan; Frank Adriaensen; Frank Tetreault; G Adventures Expedition Team; Haley Saxe; Hannah Lawson; Heidi Krajewsky; Heike Dietzmann; Hella Martens; Henry Payseure; Intrepid Citizen Science; Isabella Thompson; Jack Thomas Jr; James D Smith; Janice Crook; Javier Cotin; Jay Paul; Jeff Higgott; Jeffrey Garriock; Jeremy McKinstry; Jiri Stocker; Joel Moore; Jon Fuhrmann; Judy Barnes; Julian Cheng; Julio Santos; Karen Peeraerts; Kathryn Clouston; Kátia Silva; Katlyn Taylor; Kelly Perlewitz; Kelly Serr; Kristin Davis; Lancy Cheng; Laura K.O. Smith; Laura Mony; Laurence Fischer; Lauren Farmer; Lauren koenig; Lisa Baldwin; lsm971229; Maddie Vartanian; Marc Pelissier; Mariah Eisman; Marian Herz; Marilia Olio; Marzena Kmiecik; Maude Silly; Megan Todd-Jones; Melanie Sills; Merel Dalebout; MS Fridtjof Nansen; MS Seaventure citizen science; MV Hondius; Nastasja Hofmann; Nick Hilton; Nigel Milius; Olivier Blaud; Pamela Reynolds; perennec thierry; Per Nikolaj Bukh; Peter Clement; Peter Geraerts; Petra Glardon; Philip Precey; Pippa Low; Polar Latitudes Citizen Scientists; Rachel McCann; Raina OBrien; Ramon Lucas; Rebecca Hansen; Rebecca Hinkle; Rebecca Niemiec; Rémi Bigonneau; Rhian Cooper; Richard Schifreen; Richard Selman; Rudi Goddard; Sandra Walser; Sandy Mendel; Sandy Nelson; Sarah Catherine LaBorde; Sarah Kather; Sarah Keenan; Sara Jenner; Sebastian Killge; Sebastian Matias Lescano; Secy Cheung; sherrie weiss; SH Minerva - Swan Hellenic; SH Vega - Swan Hellenic; Sonia Pazos de Diego; Sophie Bourassa; Stephen Martin; Swathi Singh; Tamara Rempe; TARAK NATH BANERJEE; Ted Cheeseman; Thomas Mitchell; Thomas Vogelsang; Tobias Brehm; Tony Swartz; Tyler cassidy; Vadym Tkachenko; Vicki Beaver; Viking Polaris; Vivian Mires; Wade T Thomas; Wendy Hare; Xuewen Li""" ;
