<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:defcdc1c1cfffe5e962b84c973524a0fe69512b9>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Abstract:
Data in this datasets represent marine mammal sightings for ten days of Navy funded small boat surveys to photograph and satellite tag marine mammal odontocetes. Surveys were conducted from 1 to 10 February 2014 off Kauai, in and around the Pacific Missile Range Facility (PMRF), within the Hawaii Range Complex (HRC). Work was performed under HDR task order KB26 (IDIQ contract award N62470-10-D-3011, NAVFACPAC).""" ;
