<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:e4d556f8a4a7fe0513c729379300b63402662209>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
The U.S. Navy Marine Species Monitoring Program

Abstract:
Data in this dataset represent animal sightings that occurred during vessel surveys for marine mammals and sea turtles in Pearl Harbor, Hawaii. Vessel-based surveys were conducted from December 2013 to December 2014 by NAVFAC in cooperation with the Pacific Islands Fisheries Science Center. The source geodatabase was compiled by HDR under NAVFAC contract N62470-15-D-8006, task order KB11.

Supplemental information:
Sighting locations reflect the animal locations not the locations of the survey boat.
Survey tracklines are available as a static layer.
An aerial image of the survey area is available.
Relevant shore-based survey data is available at http://seamap.env.duke.edu/dataset/1955

A humpback whale sighting on 2014-01-23 15:57:00 was on land (-157.944993, 21.307519) and deleted by OBIS-SEAMAP.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Hawaii Range Complex,Marine Animal,Survey,Marine Biology,Marine mammals,Sea turtles,Visual Sighting,Vessel, Observation, Occurrence" ;
