Supplemental information:
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/index.shtml?project_id=1259">Visit STAT's project page</a> for additional information.

This dataset is a summarized representation of the telemetry locations aggregated per species per 1-degree cell.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Northern elephant seals post-breeding 2017 (aggregated per 1-degree cell)" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/fe558aab-4a93-4f9f-b525-b481ad68e2b6> ;
