<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:e634f9ef59b313e802c35dfc7b05f9bbae802cff>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """The MAGNT mammal collection, established in 1981, consists of about 8,200 databased specimens, the majority of which are from the Northern Territory.
This dataset is of marine species sourced from the Atlas of Living Australia (ALA) January 2019 (https://collections.ala.org.au/public/show/co137). Taxa have been matched to the World Register of Marine Species (WoRMS) and if not then matched to the Australian Faunal Directory (AFD)""" ;
