<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:ea68333ff8a028f80604189829afa5a24615538c>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "This dataset contains results from the Antarctic Division BIOMASS Experiment III (ADBEX III) cruise of the Nella Dan. It is the fifth cruise in a series of six, conducting a long term field survey providing data on distribution, abundance and population structure of the krill Euphausia superba in the Prydz Bay region, Antarctica. Surveys were taken off Antarctica between October and November 1985." ;
