.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:eeb1b42bd390212c7141b69bd24805bb995487c1>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description "Occurrence (presence/absence) of the crabs at Kanamai Beach, Bamburi, Mkomani and the Gazi mangrove forest, and salinity measurements at various seepage points in Gazi, Nyali, Bamburi, Kanamai, Mkomani, Shelly and Tiwi measured during the months of June, July and August 1985. The data were digitized by VLIZ from the original report: Polk, P. (Ed.) (1986). Kenya report. VUB: Brussel. 358 pp." ;
