Two sightings on 25 Aug 2009 and 02 Sept 2011 are mixed-species aggregation with approx. 20 Atlantic spotted dolphins (Stenella frontalis) and with approx. 180 Atlantic spotted dolphins (S. frontalis), respectively.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Various,Sightings, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Presence of long-beaked common dolphins off central-western Venezuela, 2008-2011" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
