Dan Costa

Dataset credits:
Data provider
Costa Lab Mammals
Originating data center
<a href="http://www.seaturtle.org/tracking/">Satellite Tracking and Analysis Tool (STAT)</a>


Abstract:
Satellite tracking of northern elephant seals from Ano Nuevo Reserve.  We deploy a variety of instruments on seals  to study their at-sea behavior and the oceanography of the northeast Pacific.

Supplemental information:
