<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:f5261f2afb59dabae78178308d0838d3b23829b2>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
HDR Environmental, Operations and Construction, Inc.

Dataset credits:
