Abstract:
Aerial marine species monitoring occurred over 29 and 30 November 2011 for a Firing Exercise (FIREX) with Integrated Maritime Portable Acoustic Scoring and Simulator (IMPASS) Exercise that occurred in the Cherry Point Range Complex (CHPT) off the eastern coast of North Carolina within the U.S. Navy’s range box W-122 (14).

Supplemental information:

All the US Navy-funded survey datasets are found in the <a href="http://seamap.env.duke.edu/partner/NAVY">OBIS-SEAMAP US Navy</a> page.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,Navy project,Aircraft,Sightings, Observation, Occurrence" ;
