<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:f571ad3321e77a5446fda5b1dc94b190cf3b1396>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Daniel Palacios

Dataset credits:
Daniel M. Palacios and Ocean Alliance

Abstract:
This dataset contains sightings of marine mammals (whales, dolphins, otariids) collected off the Galápagos Islands, Ecuador, during three expeditions by the Ocean Alliance in 1988-1989, 1993-1994, and 2000, aboard research vessels Siben (1988-1989) and Odyssey (1993-1994, 2000).

Purpose:
These sightings were collected during dedicated cruises primarily to study sperm whales.

Supplemental information:
Some records do not have time recorded. In this case, it is filled with “00:00:00” and noted in the [Notes] field.

Some records do not have group size recorded. In this case, it is filled with “1” and noted in the [Notes] field.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,sightings,cetaceans,otariids, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Marine mammal sightings off Galápagos" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/6ac63ed4-27d4-4a07-ada2-97f619f66c05> ;
.

