<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:f82b233df71479669f4a7e66a1fd3692bb0015cf>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 270 contributors in alphabetic order:

Aana Rivlin; adam maire; Aditya Srinivasan; Adrian Boyle; Ainars Zarins; Alain Bidart; aLEJANDRO sANCHEZ; Alexander Hagge; Alex Cowan; Alex Sagan; Alicia Jackson; Ali Liddle; Alisa Schulman-Janiger (California Killer Whale Project); Anand P Kruttiventi; Andrew Fischer; Andrew Peacock; Andrew Thompson; Anita Boerefijn; Anna Astafurova; Anne Meagher; Annette Bombosch; Antarctica21; Antoine Viot; Aurora Expeditions Greg Mortimer; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; BabzRobinson; Bark EUROPA; barry lynam; Ben Wallis; Berit Solstad; Brent Howard; Bryan McDonald; Byron Elvin Berger; Callie; Camilo Rada; Carina Gsottbauer; Carlos Greer; Carlos Martins; Carmel Eve; Cees Tineke; Celia Eardley; Charlotte Kirchner; Chiyo Imai Rowe; Christa Jöckel; Christian Engelke; Christian Wegener; Cindy Marple; Cindy Miller Hopkins; Clark Kelly; Claudia Roedel; Claudia Schmidt; Conor Ryan; Cottele Benny; Craig Pearce; Crawford Anderson; Dale Frink; Dan Brown; Dani Abras; Daniëlla van Broeck; Daniel Scarparolo; Darryl Ryan; Dave Katz; Denise ramirez; Dennis Greenhill; Doug Cheeseman - †; Doug Hattaway; Dr. Johannes Meiler; Dr. med Hartmut Bombosch; Duane Griffin; Duncan Jones; Elaine Reynolds; Emanuele Kuhn; Emma Collins; Eric Austin Yee; Eric Crockwell; Evelien Haels; Ezra Siegel; Fabienne+Steffen; Fanny Adomat; Franco Busetti; Frank Clark; Frank Tetreault; G Adventures Expedition Team; GAYLENE F. CHARTIER; Genna Roland; Gerald Smith; gp; Graeme Wilson; Gregory Roden; Greg Pearson; Haley Saxe; Hannah Lawson; Hannah Wirtshafter; happywhalessab; Heidi Krajewsky; Heike Dietzmann; Inia; James D Smith; James F C Hyde IV; James Moore; Jamie Coleman; Jared Funderburk; Javier Cotin; Jean-Denis Gagnon; Jeff Reynolds; Jeremy Llewelyn; Jerry Waldfogel; Jim Spiegel; Jim Wilson; JoAnn Riley; Jody Elliott; Joel Moore; Jo Feldman; John J King II; John Rogers; John Wills; Jon Deeprose; Julia; Justin Ianelli; Kami Banko; Kate Curry; Kathryn Clouston; Katlyn Taylor; Kelly Serr; Kendra Chittenden; Kevin Caughli