<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:fb4bb6ee279beacc5eb6e0775fe65e29664aab40>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """This dataset contains species distribution information on marine benthic foraminifera.  Sediment samples were collected in 1961 during a three month cruise in Hudson Bay aboard the M/V Theta. Species presence information was extracted from a report (Leslie,1965) and used to create the OBIS resource. 
/
Cet ensemble de données contient des informations sur la distribution des espèces foraminifères benthiques marines. Des échantillons de sédiments ont été prélevés en 1961 au cours d'une croisière de trois mois dans la baie d'Hudson à bord du M/V Theta.
Les informations de présence des espèces ont été extraites d'un rapport (Leslie, 1965) et ont servi pour créer la ressource OBIS.""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Biota, Oceans, Biological Classification, Occurrence, Observation" ;
    ecsummary:name "Benthic Foraminifera samples collected during a three month cruise in Hudson Bay in 1961" ;
    ecsummary:place "No spatialCoverage" ;
    ecsummary:publisher "obis" ;
    ecsummary:subjectOf <https://obis.org/dataset/77041388-7c78-43a4-905d-2426a2da06ab> ;
.

<urn:gleaner.io:oih:obis:data:fb4c8b009589d3a40f7605e586111b5c25b81c8e>
    a ecsummary:Dataset ;
    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 7 contributors in alphabetic order:

Cit Rubio; Curt Finfrock; Donna Ikenberry; Frank Wurtzel; Kimberly Nesbitt; Mike Justa; Teresa cue""" ;
    ecsummary:keywords "Occurrence,PhotoID;Visual sighting, Observation, Occurrence" ;
    ecsummary:name "Happywhale - Short-finned pilot whale in North Pacific Ocean" ;
