There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 79 contributors in alphabetic order:

Adelie Xiaohang Li; Adrian Boyle; Alex Cowan; Andrew Emmerson; Anita Rude; Ann; Annette Bombosch; Barbara Messner; Bart Van Gelder; Biørn Stasinski; Carina Gsottbauer; Cees Tineke; Chloe; Christian Engelke; Conor Ryan; David O'Connor; Dominique Vening; Doug Cheeseman - †; Doug Gould; Gizella Spencer; Greta Henderson; Hadleigh Measham; Hannah Brightley; Hans Verdaat; Heidi Krajewsky; Húsavík Whale Museum; Jamie Coleman; Janne Kangaspunta; Jeff Higgott; Jeff Reynolds; Jérôme JACOB; Joel Moore; Joy van der Beek; Julian Vrohlings; Katharina Stoll; Keely Crowder; Kelly zhang; Kenneth Tolopka; Kerstin Langenberger; Laura Monterde; Léa Zinsli; Loes de Heus; Lomvi; Marian Herz; Marijke Nita de Boer; Marilia Olio; Marit Pedersen; Mary Want; Menno Schaefer; Milton Lum; MS Fram; MS Spitsbergen; MV Hondius; Nacho Oria; Nate Crosby; Nicolas PANIER; Nigel Puttick; Olivia Capeillere; Olivier Blaud; Petra Glardon; Philip Stone; Philip van Dueren; Phil Schultz; Pippa Low; Rayann Elzein; Rémi Bigonneau; Rich Roberts; Robyn Carmel; Sara Jenner; Shawn Bradley; Sil Schuuring; Sophie Ballagh; Steffo Polar; steve; Steven van de Vijver; Suzanne Wafer; Tobias Brehm; Ulf Velander; whitney van arsdale""" ;
