    ecsummary:description """Original provider:
Happywhale

Dataset credits:
Happywhale and contributors

Abstract:
Happywhale.com is a resource to help you know whales as individuals, and to benefit conservation science with rich data about individual whales.

Supplemental information:
Sightings and images were submitted to Happywhale by contributors. A portion of the Happywhale data were transferred to OBIS-SEAMAP upon the agreement between Happywhale and OBIS-SEAMAP.

There may be duplicate records among Happywhale datasets and other OBIS-SEAMAP datasets. The precision of date/time vary per record. Some records have date accuracy up to year only.

This dataset includes sightings and photos from the following 38 contributors in alphabetic order:

adam maire; Adrian Boyle; Andrew Thompson; Andy Wolff; Annette Bombosch; Aurora Expeditions Sylvia Earle; Beth Caldwell; Byron Elvin Berger; Cobalt; Conor Ryan; Daniela Derron; David Gamba; Doug Cheeseman - †; Ed Bennett; Ella Potts; Frank Adriaensen; Genna Roland; Ian Lewis; Javier Cotin; Jeff Higgott; Joel Moore; Jo Feldman; Kimberly Nesbitt; KP Science; Marian Herz; Marilia Olio; Mark Harris; Pat Murphy; Per Nikolaj Bukh; Phillip Hunter; Régis PERDRIAT; Richard Wilson; Sarah Kather; Siyu Liu; Stefan Bernhard; steve; Thomas Vogelsang; Valerie Bronckers""" ;
